        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_partnership",
            "type": "partnership",
            "heading": "Your JavaScript toolkit just got bigger",
            "body_html": "<p>Following our 2025 <a href=\"https://blog.ag-grid.com/ag-grid-and-bryntum-join-forces-to-strengthen-developer-tooling-for-modern-web-applications/\">partnership with Bryntum</a>, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning.</p><p>You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Scheduler Pro brings the same standard to dependency-aware scheduling and resource planning — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.</p>",
            "body_text": "Following our 2025 partnership with Bryntum, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning. You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Scheduler Pro brings the same standard to dependency-aware scheduling and resource planning — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.",
            "logo_light_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-light.svg",
            "logo_dark_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-dark.svg",
            "logo_alt": "AG Grid x Bryntum partnership"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_intro_video_schedulerpro",
            "type": "intro-video",
            "video_src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/W0CnKcrnoIc?feature=oembed",
            "title": "Bryntum Scheduler Pro Intro"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_ca62340a695d26f1e58162162bd1cb2b",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Connect Your Tasks",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Once your tasks and dependencies are in place, the professional scheduling engine takes care of the rest by:</p> <ul> <li>Organizing tasks based on how they relate to each other and the rules you’ve defined.</li> <li>Automatically updating dependent tasks when you move a leading task.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Once your tasks and dependencies are in place, the professional scheduling engine takes care of the rest by: Organizing tasks based on how they relate to each other and the rules you’ve defined. Automatically updating dependent tasks when you move a leading task.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "View all features",
                    "href": "/products/schedulerpro/features",
                    "title": "View all features"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
