        {
            "id": "block_86cff8bcd91213c53bcd78636afc0cd6",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Avoid Over-Allocating Your Resources",
            "body_html": "<p>Manage your team’s workload with a built-in histogram and make faster and fairer decisions.</p> <ul> <li>Bright red highlights let yout instantly spot over-capcity workloads <span class=\"s1\">without digging through tables or reports.</span></li> <li>Adjust task assignments for balanced planning.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Manage your team’s workload with a built-in histogram and make faster and fairer decisions. Bright red highlights let yout instantly spot over-capcity workloads without digging through tables or reports. Adjust task assignments for balanced planning.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Try demo",
                    "href": "/products/schedulerpro/examples/resourcehistogram",
                    "title": "Try demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "image",
                    "src": "../assets/schedulerpro/schedulerpro-resourcehistogram-svalbard-2-scaled.png",
                    "alt": "",
                    "width": "1240",
                    "height": "663",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/schedulerpro-resourcehistogram-svalbard-2-scaled.png"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_b27deebef856877e482370a5bc9b1a9a",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["video-file", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Use Skill-Based Task Assignments",
            "body_html": "<p>Let Scheduler Pro handle the logic behind the scenes for efficient planning:</p> <ul> <li>Easily assign the right tasks to the right people.</li> <li>Match tasks with team members based on skills and availability.</li> <li>Automatically schedule tasks or drag and drop them into suggested time slots.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Let Scheduler Pro handle the logic behind the scenes for efficient planning: Easily assign the right tasks to the right people. Match tasks with team members based on skills and availability. Automatically schedule tasks or drag and drop them into suggested time slots.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Try demo",
                    "href": "/products/schedulerpro/examples/skill-matching/",
                    "title": "Try demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "video",
                    "src": "../assets/schedulerpro/schedulerpro-skill-matching-zoom.mp4.mp4",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/schedulerpro-skill-matching-zoom.mp4.mp4"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_db9616ac89f5620c3b5018eb7d1c9498",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Enjoy Intelligent, Adaptive Planning",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Schedule with confidence for the real world:</p> <ul> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Identify peak activity periods and overloaded categories using the heatmap.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/schedulerpro/examples/nested-events-dependencies/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">nested events</span></a> to simplify handling related tasks.</li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/schedulerpro/examples/travel-time/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Account for travel time</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to plan callouts and field routing more efficiently.</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Resolve </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/schedulerpro/examples/conflicts/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">scheduling conflicts</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and maintain the integrity of the schedule.</span></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Schedule with confidence for the real world: Identify peak activity periods and overloaded categories using the heatmap. Use nested events to simplify handling related tasks. Account for travel time to plan callouts and field routing more efficiently. Resolve scheduling conflicts and maintain the integrity of the schedule.",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "nested events",
                    "href": "https://bryntum.com/products/schedulerpro/examples/nested-events-dependencies/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Account for travel time",
